{#
   The no-pay-to-win band — new in the redesign. A single full-width gold slab
   between #scouting and the Rich List.

   Placed deliberately: the Rich List ranks owners by money drawn out of their
   clubs, and read cold that can look like a spending leaderboard. Stating that
   nothing is purchasable immediately before it is what stops the ranking being
   misread. Not a section heading, so it carries no id and no aria-labelledby —
   it is one statement, not a region of content.
#}
<section class="nptw-section">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="nptw-band">
            <p class="nptw-headline pixel">NO PAY-TO-WIN.</p>
            <p class="nptw-copy">Success is earned inside the simulation, through smart decisions and patience. Nothing in the shop buys you a better club.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
